<title>USA: Gentex ships mirrors for Lincoln Navigator.</title>
<headline>Gentex ships mirrors for Lincoln Navigator.</headline>
<dateline>ZEELAND, Mich. 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gentex Corp, which provides products for the automotive and fire-protection industries, on Monday said it started shipping interior automatic dimming mirrors for Ford Motor Co's Lincoln Navigator sport/utility vehicle.</p>
<p>The Navigator goes on sale July 1, Gentex said.</p>
<p>The Night Vision Safety Mirror is standard equipment on the Navigator.</p>
<p>Gentex shares were up 1/8 at 20 early Monday afternoon.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
